3. Quantinuum Nexus run evidence — `knowledge/nexus/`
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Measurement counts from QAOA jobs executed on Quantinuum's H2-1LE hardware and
H2-Emulator, retrieved through the `qnexus` SDK under the project's own Nexus
account. These are *our* run results, not Quantinuum's data product; each import
carries its own in-toto attestation and digest chain (`index.json`).

"Quantinuum" and "Nexus" are trademarks of their respective owners, used here
nominatively to identify the hardware a measurement came from. This project is
not affiliated with, endorsed by, or an official product of Quantinuum.

